 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(1, 8), pawn(6, 7), knight(3, 6), queen(5, 3), queen(3, 3),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 10,\n        hazards: [X(1, 5), X(2, 5), X(3, 5), X(4, 5), X(5, 5), X(7, 5), X(8, 5), X(6, 4), X(6, 6), X(2, 6), X(3, 7)],\n        kingPen: ['a7', 'b7', 'a8', 'b8'],\n      },\n    ),"
